chezmoi dots pkg bump — Update pinned versions and checksums in the source

USAGE
  chezmoi dots pkg bump [<pin>...] [options]

ARGUMENTS
  pin  Release name or archive repository path (owner/repo) (default: all pins).
  Default: write updated pins and checksums to .chezmoidata/packages.toml and the externals files.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --dry-run  show what would change, write nothing (default: "false")

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots pkg bump --dry-run
  chezmoi dots pkg bump example-tool
  chezmoi dots pkg bump octocat/example
